ry</h3><span class="pill">WannaTalk</span></div><div id="bookingSummary" class="phone-bubble">Choose a provider, date and time to preview your booking.</div><button class="btn" style="margin-top:16px;width:100%" onclick="confirmBooking()">Confirm Booking</button></aside></div></section>
